![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The temporary directory created with `fs.mkdtempSync` is never cleaned up. Wrap the test execution in a `try...finally` block to ensure the temporary directory is always deleted, and wrap the cleanup logic (`fs.rmSync`) in a `try...catch` block inside the `finally` block to prevent cleanup errors from masking primary test failures.

```javascript
    const tempDir = fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'phase-b-schema-projection-'));

    try {
      runCli(['--root', repoRoot(), '--out-root', tempDir, '--write']);

      const contractText = readGenerated(
        tempDir,
        'artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.v1.json',
      );
      const readbackText = readGenerated(
        tempDir,
        'artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.readback.md',
      );
      const validatorText = readGenerated(
        tempDir,
        'artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.validator-result.json',
      );
      const combined = `${contractText}\\n${readbackText}\\n${validatorText}`;

      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/https:\/\/[a-z0-9-]+\.supabase\.co/i);
      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/postgres(?:ql)?:\/\/[^\\\\s"']+/i);
      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]+/);
      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE|service_role_key|sb_secret_/i);
      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/\\b(?:supabase|psql|curl)\\s+[^\\\\n]*(?:insert|update|delete|upsert|storage|rpc)\\b/i);
      expect(combined).not.toMatch(/\\blearner_(?:id|email|name)\\b/i);
    } finally {
      try {
        fs.rmSync(tempDir, { recursive: true, force: true });
      } catch (err) {
        // Ignore cleanup errors to prevent masking primary test failures
      }
    }
```

<details>
<summary>References</summary>

1. When cleaning up temporary directories or workspaces in test helpers, wrap the cleanup logic (e.g., fs.rmSync) in a try...catch block inside the finally block to prevent cleanup errors from masking primary test or generation failures.
</details>

